From: Nehal J Wani <nehaljw.kkd1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Jun 2017 01:08:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] define ssize_t as int

Rebased for 1.0.0: upstream replaced the code block this patch
targeted with new MDB_FMT_Z/MDB_PRIy macros, so the diff is redone
against the new context; the fix itself is unchanged.

---
 libraries/liblmdb/mdb_stat.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libraries/liblmdb/mdb_stat.c b/libraries/liblmdb/mdb_stat.c
index a7315d8..f7b0d95 100644
--- a/libraries/liblmdb/mdb_stat.c
+++ b/libraries/liblmdb/mdb_stat.c
@@ -16,6 +16,10 @@
 #include <string.h>
 #include <unistd.h>
 #include "lmdb.h"
+
+#ifdef	_WIN32
+#define	ssize_t	int
+#endif
 
 #define Z	MDB_FMT_Z
 #define Yu	MDB_PRIy(u)
--
2.5.1.windows.1
